### \uc0\u25552 \u31034 \u35789 \u65288 \u36817 \u25112 \u22411 \u65289 \
> anime game enemy concept art, full body reference. A low-tier shadow minion made of flowing dark purple energy, about 1.6m tall. Humanoid upper body with unnaturally long arms ending in three sharp energy claws instead of fingers. No legs\'97lower body fades into a shadow trail, floating just above the ground. No face\'97a denser concentration of dark energy at the head with two faint purple-white glowing points. Entire body is semi-transparent dark purple-black with simple flowing violet markings on the surface. Right arm extends into a translucent dark purple energy blade with faint edge glow. Hovering, gliding pose. Designed as a swarm enemy\'97not individually threatening, menacing in numbers. Anime cinematic dark fantasy style. Clean reference on dark gray background. NOT a biological monster\'97pure energy entity.\
\
### \uc0\u25552 \u31034 \u35789 \u65288 \u36828 \u31243 \u22411 \u65289 \
> same enemy type, variant. Slightly smaller (1.4m), no blade arm. Instead, both hands cradle a sphere of compressed dark purple energy between them, glowing brighter as if about to be launched. The energy sphere has a brighter violet core. Same flowing shadow body, same simple markings, same faceless head. Poised in a throwing stance. Anime dark fantasy enemy concept. Clean reference on dark gray background.\
\
### \uc0\u25552 \u31034 \u35789 \u65288 \u32676 \u20687 \'b7\u35268 \u27169 \u24863 \u65289 \
> anime cinematic wide shot. A battlefield flooded with dozens of shadow minions\'97dark purple translucent humanoid energy forms surging forward like a tide. In the foreground, one minion is mid-shatter, its body cracking apart into glowing purple fragments that dissolve into light particles. The swarm stretches to the horizon. Dark purple storm sky. The sheer number is the terror, not the individual design. Anime dark fantasy, epic scale, overwhelming horde composition. Aspect ratio 16:9.\
